; DIMLINEAR, the Mtext option ([0.8.1-RT3], work #930): before Text, as AutoCAD
; ([testoM/Testo/Angolo/Orizzontale/Verticale/Ruotato] and, after Horizontal or Vertical,
; [testoM/Testo/Angolo] in autocad-quote.txt, dxf-test-file 5170f18); from the command line it
; asks "Enter dimension text <measurement>:" and writes the replaced text, as Text (PT3
; card, point 3). First dimension: a text with <>; second, after Horizontal, a text
; without <>; third: Esc at the text prompt leaves nothing, then U undoes the second.
; Values as dimlinear/opzioni (same points, ISO-25): the text above the line does not
; move with its content, six graphics records after each dimension, so 257 and 264.
DIMLINEAR
0,0
50,0
; cambia con #930
M
<> mm
25,10
DIMLINEAR
0,60
30,100
H
M
Quota
40,80
!report
DIMLINEAR
0,120
40,120
M
!esc
U
